abstract: >-
  A framework manuscript on managing personal and professional context with
  AI agents: one self-contained folder per theme, in plain portable files,
  where agents file, distill and prune while the human captures, decides and
  deletes. Appendix A and the Part V templates are dedicated to the public
  domain under CC0 1.0.
keywords:
